{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_106_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_106_title", "source_sha256": "b5500b87296522bd6cc83fb0b0ae11a2d6fbe97bb573e5e172f4e170bc2960a1", "ja": "日替わり定食、大盛りで！", "zh": "每日特餐，饭要大份的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_106_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_106_synopsis", "source_sha256": "e9601f1ae522f817f6760735cdfc03319c1b7d255269ab8f147639438f43f0bd", "ja": "進路の話で友達と気まずくなり、レッスンに\n集中できない美奈子。更に弟とも喧嘩をして\nしまい、自分はお節介なのかもと落ち込むが\nプロデューサーや仲間に励まされ、自分の\nためにワガママになる事を決める。", "zh": "美奈子因为升学去向的话题和朋友闹得不愉快，\n导致无法集中精力参加练习。后来她又和弟弟吵了架，\n陷入了怀疑自己是不是太爱多管闲事的低落情绪中，\n但在制作人和同伴们的鼓励下，她决定\n要为了自己而任性一回。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_106_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_106_1000_p", "source_sha256": "102b4a770575af2f90e24b1c72ab2419c5359739f20221e32cab2a76a0e7976f", "ja": "（今日も1日、定期公演に向けてのレッスンだ。\nけど、美奈子がどこかぼんやりしているような……？）", "zh": "（今天也是第1天，要为定期公演进行练习。可是，美奈子好像有些心不在焉……？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_106_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_106_1001_044miz", "source_sha256": "2f81b11e3c06fa1a4c85032452995d2af9b03fd028407b09c2fab2d3ce2882c1", "ja": "それではまず、準備運動からです。\nペアになって、入念に。……いっち、にー。", "zh": "那么首先，从热身运动开始。\n两人一组，仔细地做。……一、二。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_106_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_106_1003_022ser", "source_sha256": "4058fe9a4b3daccf5cd69019f99281a200359c5d2b59037ede671b1deda2b6ff", "ja": "美奈子さん、どうかしたんですか？\n……美奈子さん？", "zh": "美奈子小姐，怎么了吗？……美奈子小姐？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_106_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_106_1004_019min", "source_sha256": "9b6a833259a1dd19f81d788eabffaf0179ff2c8c2813caed08fc71bf019a7cf6", "ja": "えっ？　あ、ごめんね、すぐ準備するよ！\nえっと、どの曲からだっけ？", "zh": "咦？啊，对不起，我马上准备！\n那个，要从哪首歌开始来着？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_106_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_106_1005_044miz", "source_sha256": "93bc613d84888294265ae74d8568d6da3bae68e7c665d989a284f24f31ea3ecf", "ja": "本番を想定した通しだそうなので……\nまずは、頭からですね。", "zh": "听说是要按照正式演出那样从头到尾排练……\n那就先从开头开始吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_106_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_106_1006_019min", "source_sha256": "9f6210d8992a2be84102e63bd4186ff42d142a26a29f5185053754b9656fffca", "ja": "あ、そっか。\nごめんね、ちょっとボーッとしちゃってたみたい。", "zh": "啊，这样啊。\n对不起，我好像刚才有点走神了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_106_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_106_1007_040tam", "source_sha256": "5435d1a5547f5816fa4b3c8c617b497aee58e2dcecd1d46ff4e313ea67a6cf5c", "ja": "みなこ～、大丈夫？　お腹いたいなら、\nあっちでお休みしてたほうがいいぞ……。", "zh": "美奈子～，没事吧？要是肚子疼，还是去那边休息一下比较好……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_106_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_106_1008_019min", "source_sha256": "7bf0a52d75ab7eea049b64022f20b94087c86bc4eecde582bf77bf0ffb61dd6e", "ja": "ううん、大丈夫だよ！　心配かけちゃってゴメンね、\n環ちゃん。すぐ準備するから！", "zh": "嗯，没事的！让你担心了，对不起，环。马上就准备好！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_106_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_106_1010_p", "source_sha256": "e76178317fb198be981042e9ba2db0d45b1927a168e2bca7ac2443f0ad58bc91", "ja": "みんな、レッスンお疲れ様！\n……あれ、美奈子は？", "zh": "大家，练习辛苦了！\n……咦，美奈子呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_106_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_106_1011_022ser", "source_sha256": "7aa548777f546cbe64aa74637eee7927cd4ecca1b1d8d4d6f889abfb69c3c620", "ja": "お疲れさまです、{$P$}さん。\n美奈子さんなら、もう帰りましたよ？", "zh": "辛苦了，{$P$}先生。\n美奈子已经回去了哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_106_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_106_1012_p", "source_sha256": "3799d641fc5eb300b34141c5995d42da4570490785bdba3737d674af86a4218e", "ja": "あ、そうだったのか。しまったな……。\n様子が変だったから、ちょっと話したかったんだけど。", "zh": "啊，原来是这样啊。糟糕……\n因为美奈子看起来有点不对劲，本来想和她聊聊的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_106_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_106_1013_040tam", "source_sha256": "0d3e3af4c3e5027cc97c80dd6316c203367855404b57456c7b4fd7b8109dc3a0", "ja": "みなこ、元気なかったよね……。でも熱はないって！\nおでこさわったけど、ふつうだった！", "zh": "美奈子好像很没精神呢……不过她说没有发烧！\n环摸了摸她的额头，很正常哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_106_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_106_1014_044miz", "source_sha256": "5ab8e1ca0e37e2d72cb6c830be1b35127587b97b17e84d925c6c8b664afa0454", "ja": "体調が悪い、というわけではないようです。\n佐竹さん、どうしたのでしょう。……心配。", "zh": "看起来并不是身体不舒服。\n佐竹小姐这是怎么了呢……好担心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_106_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_106_1015_050jul", "source_sha256": "373c22e35110b625ef5916d336bba95d1029454d2e3fdfb9b553e572617522ac", "ja": "ウチらもそれとなく聞いてみたんだけど、\n「大丈夫」としか言わなくてさ。", "zh": "我们也旁敲侧击地问过了，可她只说“没事”。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_106_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_106_1016_050jul", "source_sha256": "68b585aa4d3e0bc5d4ab549c41b740a075c341a5dde0bca0c58573b54a22fba4", "ja": "ひとりで抱え込んでなきゃいいんだけど……。", "zh": "只要她没有一个人闷在心里就好了……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_106_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_106_1017_p", "source_sha256": "72e2122fcb6fc7cbbdeb361a0733fbfeb3a1b52cbe181c53492f61743a707247", "ja": "（みんな心配そうにしている……無理もないな。\nよし。帰りに、美奈子の家に寄ってみるか）", "zh": "（大家看起来都很担心……这也难怪。好，回去的时候去美奈子家看看吧。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_106_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_106_1019_minakohaha", "source_sha256": "db7d3d927796243916beef137c7325369b78fa7db1f7af7434e4075b414dbfa1", "ja": "美奈子、これ5番テーブルね！\nそれが終わったら、片づけお願いー！", "zh": "美奈子，这张是5号桌！\n收拾完之后，拜托你收拾一下啦——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_106_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_106_1021_minakohaha", "source_sha256": "0b1aa87ad5b6a4ea8c58b64794a0bd4c52caef540210bf2b23b5d59101c9c1aa", "ja": "美奈子？　どうかしたの？", "zh": "美奈子？怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_106_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_106_1022_019min", "source_sha256": "1bf621e7f51681ebb92a575b10a193cc98443a358488ff1768dcd6b28d218147", "ja": "えっ？　\n……あ、お母さん。呼んだ？", "zh": "诶？\n……啊，妈妈。你叫我吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_106_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_106_1023_minakohaha", "source_sha256": "2434b672100f5315c152bb699ca9de79cbe20db9b0fe5fae8fbedf8e7f86cdb0", "ja": "呼んだ？じゃないわよ。\nこれ、5番テーブルにお願いね。", "zh": "什么叫“你叫我吗？”啊。\n这个，麻烦送到5号桌哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_106_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_106_1024_019min", "source_sha256": "79070f9769a913461164eabb7befa99341a0b95282742176d8c05d34295fc1d9", "ja": "は、はーい！\n……すみません、お待たせしましたー！", "zh": "好、好的！\n……不好意思，让您久等了——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_106_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_106_1025_se", "source_sha256": "ca1bb861cd7ac91e1d1642d22016a45edc150633af952bdade736af5f0946b1e", "ja": "ガラッ", "zh": "哗啦", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_106_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_106_1026_minakoototo", "source_sha256": "f70fa7e89dfd6315c5b7dabb7e553ab0036ffae3d8f915f862e69bbdd1826ee5", "ja": "……ぐすっ。ただいま……。", "zh": "……呜。我回来了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_106_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_106_1027_019min", "source_sha256": "8fc7a82bdff3415f1e5c171d3f76339897a965efc90e49b2b46efb49b0a5843b", "ja": "あっ、琥太朗（こたろう）、おかえり……\nって、どうしたの！？　なんで泣いてるの！？", "zh": "啊，琥太朗，你回来啦……\n不对，你怎么了！？怎么在哭啊！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_106_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_106_1028_kotarou", "source_sha256": "64bd3d6c469e45e9095f19f6eaa39fa5504e9b2c0f5b4b045868e5982ecc60ef", "ja": "うっ、ぐす……な、なんでもない……！", "zh": "呜、呜咽……没、没什么……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_106_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_106_1029_019min", "source_sha256": "ed4ce8f90a17e0e5022341e49ff5a46c5c45f3f3edc211440c5f926b1c103b34", "ja": "なんでもなかったら、そんな風に泣かないでしょ？\n何があったの？", "zh": "如果没发生什么，怎么会哭成这样呢？\n到底发生什么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_106_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_106_1030_kotarou", "source_sha256": "694669cc86de116bad94898d1057e4f99f772180d421b8ebd45afc25c23f7e18", "ja": "ぐすっ……。\n……学校で、デブって言われた……。", "zh": "抽泣……  \n……在学校被人说成是胖子了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_106_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_106_1031_019min", "source_sha256": "9ce12e7df174cebe84ef39ec934df71051d5b77591931c71cf28c7aead2edad7", "ja": "えっ！？", "zh": "咦！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_106_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_106_1032_kotarou", "source_sha256": "17215a1dfeaf348405d32c148dd04a4aebdf8f055a596f176b37b8847fba2191", "ja": "マラソンで、ビリになって……。\n「デブだから走るのが遅いんだ」って……。", "zh": "跑马拉松时，成了最后一名……\n还被说“因为你胖，所以跑得慢”。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_106_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_106_1033_kotarou", "source_sha256": "da9e210c48098885cee4ee4a82617154f035c535b729303bb95010a5abddf404", "ja": "ぼく、もうご飯食べない！", "zh": "我再也不吃饭了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_106_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_106_1034_019min", "source_sha256": "4f74a698a954e7b312fe32dc5b0a63dac8f6f0656fc4d572d4a5b9ee939ca5f3", "ja": "ええっ！？　そんな……ダメだよ、体に悪いし！\nちゃんと食べなくちゃ、また……。", "zh": "诶！？怎么能这样……不行，会对身体不好啊！\n一定要好好吃饭，不然又会……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_106_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_106_1035_kotarou", "source_sha256": "7c122ef2b397de4ca9826cb6a48b943a6b94661bfe26cc3afecb619810e43e76", "ja": "……ぼく、小さいころみたいに体弱くないもん！\nお姉ちゃんのおせっかい！", "zh": "……我才没有像小时候那样身体虚弱呢！\n姐姐多管闲事！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_106_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_106_1037_minakohaha", "source_sha256": "ed70f691d1ea50732ee3a1cb97faef0e4400908963c7a7592deb452f77aa35d5", "ja": "こら、琥太朗！\nお姉ちゃんにひどいこと言わないの！", "zh": "喂，琥太朗！\n不许对姐姐说过分的话！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_106_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_106_1038_kotarou", "source_sha256": "fdeac1525a423e9087f9036f1e5874ef4acd5c20b5d375f62260d4915f8a9053", "ja": "お姉ちゃんもお母さんも、太ってないから\nぼくの気持ちがわからないんだ！　ほっといてよ！", "zh": "姐姐和妈妈都不胖，根本不懂我的感受！别管我！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
