{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_106_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_106_1068_p", "source_sha256": "76919135dbb8edf4312e9854721c02a43ecb0f5bcccbf50c10f5ce00d18dcec7", "ja": "そうか……学校で、友達とそんな事があったのか。", "zh": "这样啊……你在学校和朋友之间发生了那样的事啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_106_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_106_1069_019min", "source_sha256": "48402384cbe945413efc94d9ea8c4e0f1f3c30b11f42a09b56d796b6f3362aff", "ja": "はい。……ちょっと、なんていうか……\n悲しい気持ちになっちゃって。", "zh": "是的……该怎么说呢……\n不知不觉就觉得有点难过。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_106_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_106_1070_019min", "source_sha256": "977fa239d332f44beb51cac0786badb671608f8d2ece3cffa0aaf8163be9f934", "ja": "私だって、将来に……不安がないわけじゃないのに。\nなんだか勝手に決められちゃうみたいで……。", "zh": "我也会对未来……感到不安的。\n却好像被人随便替我做决定了一样……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_106_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_106_1071_p", "source_sha256": "3d437624059171e2ca3ebdcaf7a2b0c97ce2f32098831c28ccbd478465f590df", "ja": "他人事だからな。\n周りは、好きなように言えると思うよ。", "zh": "因为事不关己，周围的人当然可以想说什么就说什么。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_106_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_106_1072_019min", "source_sha256": "051fa13da48d143b7afbc89bcdf43315ff6b47f641cfc3a44b8fc6ff169900c7", "ja": "でも、私……弟に「お節介」って言われて、\nハッとしちゃったんです。", "zh": "可是，我……被弟弟说是“多管闲事”，一下子醒悟过来了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_106_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_106_1073_019min", "source_sha256": "da8f1f510f0b6418f60a5babf92a17b0f99b083092f64a7ee3bc7887aea0b569", "ja": "それって、私がクラスメイトに思ったことと……\n「余計なお世話」と、同じなんじゃないかって。", "zh": "我不禁想到，这和我对同学产生的想法……是不是一样，都属于“多管闲事”呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_106_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_106_1074_019min", "source_sha256": "51abb173062e833a608f09a01d036cf92de3760580d96d58bb8e60736ed6be36", "ja": "すこしくらい太っていても、健康なほうがいいと思って\nました。でもそれは、私の意見でしかなくて……。", "zh": "我觉得，稍微胖一点也比身体健康要好。\n但那终究只是我的个人看法……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_106_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_106_1075_019min", "source_sha256": "9957ad40dc36b2826893906afc06f96cb571371e481a271f38571e56ccc93657", "ja": "弟にしてみれば、すごく、余計なお世話ですよね。\nそんなことにも気づかないなんて……ダメだなぁ、私。", "zh": "对弟弟来说，这肯定很多管闲事吧。\n连这种事都没注意到……我真是太没用了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_106_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_106_1076_p", "source_sha256": "48313c9cdd0bee00137950eac485fb95d33bc6ca6b0776ea2dbd623dfa71e19d", "ja": "でも美奈子のそれは、相手のことを思っての行動だろ？\n弟さんだって、本当はわかってるんじゃないかな。", "zh": "不过，美奈子那也是为对方着想才会这么做的吧？\n你弟弟其实也明白的吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_106_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_106_1077_p", "source_sha256": "5bb4fd8dd92228fd028a8afa32fe607c27b6ac279d62466241d85924b0f1f009", "ja": "俺だって、いつもありがたいと思ってるよ。", "zh": "我也一直都很感激啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_106_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_106_1078_019min", "source_sha256": "a443728a8175b991932eba7c1377a7feb90b5c05a89ee687339a5281a0ed75e9", "ja": "{$P$}さん……。", "zh": "{$P$}先生……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_106_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_106_1079_p", "source_sha256": "6d6cee8feb6b5ea7d2813db035823cf9c29fd919fb35ae29cab41a3e845b4f7c", "ja": "美奈子が誰かの世話をするのは、\n見返りを求めてるわけじゃないだろ？", "zh": "美奈子照顾别人，并不是为了索求回报，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
