{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_106_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_106_1095_040tam", "source_sha256": "b8289b8cb598ad6b6fc780d2563ab2474a3f84571bc60707c84473d938947662", "ja": "みなこ。\nうっとうしいって、どういう意味？", "zh": "美奈子。\n烦人是什么意思呀？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_106_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_106_1096_019min", "source_sha256": "baaa7c7eeb3a421d28051833ae530d4eab9a49db30a819d06132ee30952f3d69", "ja": "あ、えっとね……私っていつも、みんなのお世話を\n焼いてばっかりだけど。迷惑じゃないかな？ってこと。", "zh": "啊，那个……我总是在照顾大家。就是在想，会不会给大家添麻烦呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_106_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_106_1097_040tam", "source_sha256": "05604d01a3ba803e45fd51b007227baa0d2eaf893a8dd382b8a8f2ed836e18ac", "ja": "なーんだ。たまき、そんなの全然思ったことないぞ！\nだって、みなこやさしいもん！", "zh": "原来是这个啊。环从来没这么想过！因为美奈子很温柔嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_106_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_106_1098_040tam", "source_sha256": "83700e047b504223760df74954579a433b4c880d26faf1ccc440dd1759b05124", "ja": "この前もたまきのハンカチ、\nいっしょに探してくれたし。", "zh": "之前还帮环一起找过手帕呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_106_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_106_1099_022ser", "source_sha256": "298152b684da685ff45bc5a15a66fab2ac58f6f9babb64483f6b6f8b268d9faa", "ja": "わたしもです！　いつも気にかけてくださる\n美奈子さんのこと、大好きです♪", "zh": "我也是！最喜欢总是关心我的美奈子姐姐了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_106_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_106_1100_044miz", "source_sha256": "bc47fb62dd259713b059abd4c80c0a00948a350458c993b5326af8f01cd5eaf5", "ja": "はい。むしろ、迷惑をかけているのは\n私たちのほうではないかと。……心配、だぞ。", "zh": "是的。倒不如说，给您添麻烦的是我们吧。\n……我可是很担心的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
