{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_106_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_106_1102_050jul", "source_sha256": "efd9b831ee953f68bc397a3b3f407f08a21ef3c804dab4af33d9d79b7ed004a2", "ja": "ていうか、鬱陶しいって思ったらちゃんと言ってる。\nウチら、そんなことで遠慮する間柄じゃないだろ？", "zh": "话说回来，要是觉得烦，我会直接说的。\n我们之间也没必要因为这种事客气吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_106_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_106_1103_019min", "source_sha256": "81a4feee572958bd05cc88bceab514ab4297c77d44f4d6663d9a619621348af3", "ja": "えへへ……そっか♪　\nありがと、ジュリアちゃん！", "zh": "嘿嘿……这样啊♪  \n谢谢你，茱莉亚！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_106_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_106_1104_050jul", "source_sha256": "856dd7830448cc39cf98c6fc1ef9862ad724b2a4a807b261bf5d66c5c02cd179", "ja": "いや、感謝されるようなことじゃないだろ……\nあたしだって、美奈子には世話になってるしな。", "zh": "不是，没什么值得你道谢的……\n我也一直受美奈子照顾嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
