{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_106_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_106_1106_019min", "source_sha256": "4f0663056c5de5917030cb12f0228607955d88e2618d006ae208c46e3ef8fea6", "ja": "うん！　みんな、本当にありがとう！\n……よーしっ。それじゃ今日も、レッスン始めるよ！", "zh": "嗯！真的谢谢大家！\n……好——那今天也开始练习吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
